   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Geneva Call 2008-2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GenevaCall 2008-2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Geneva Call arbetar f&#xf6;r att engagera icke-statliga akt&#xf6;rer i efterlevnad av internationell humanit&#xe4;r r&#xe4;tt och mr-r&#xe4;tt, med specifik fokus p&#xe5; respekt f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rbudet mot personminor, samt samarbete med internationella humanit&#xe4;ra akt&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r att reducera effekter av personminor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Geneva Call is engaging armed non-State actors (NSAs) towards compliance with the norms of international humanitarian law and human rights law, specifically focused on respect for the AP mine ban and cooperation with humanitarian organizations working to reduce the effects of AP mines.</narrative>
  </description>
